    "updated_at": "2022-02-01T17:18:07Z",
    "body": "Yes, I think using `(ArrayBufferView or undefined)` is the way to go, or if that doesn't work for some reason then using `any` since this is just a return-value dictionary and so its IDL types don't really matter.\r\n\r\nWe should have both properties.",
